        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 544,
      "author": {
        "id": 1136059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T23:06:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah the test team only needs to go to prod, but we\u0027re also using CR50_SQA to give to people who need to switch a board from prod to prepvt.\nAlso probably we want to use it so people can go from whatever to the MP test board id, so they can verify mp releases.",
      "parentUuid": "93d905fa_dd9066f0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 544,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 544,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "e1a3e6d2f902e692400aa4d207c13044a7173d0a",
